msgid "<p>The Editoria11y <strong><em>@type</em></strong> view is missing.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>La vista <strong><em>@type</em></strong> di Editoria11y è mancante.</p>"

msgid ""
"<p>There are three view configurations this module installs, found in its /"
"config/install folder. Each must be installed for this dashboard to display "
"results.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Questo modulo installa tre configurazioni di viste, presenti nella "
"cartella /config/install. Tutte devono essere installate affinché il "
"dashboard possa mostrare i risultati.</p>"

msgid ""
"<p>To fix: copy and paste the contents of <strong>/editoria11y/config/"
"install/views.view.ed11y_@type.yml</strong> into a \"View\" type import at "
"<a href=\"/admin/config/development/configuration/single/import\">/admin/"
"config/development/configuration/single/import</a>. If you sync your "
"configuration to the filesystem, be sure to include these Views in your "
"repository.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Per risolvere: copia e incolla il contenuto di <strong>/editoria11y/"
"config/install/views.view.ed11y_@type.yml</strong> in un’importazione di "
"tipo “View” su <a href=\"/admin/config/development/configuration/single/"
"import\">/admin/config/development/configuration/single/import</a>. Se "
"sincronizzi la configurazione con il filesystem, assicurati di includere "
"queste viste nel repository.</p>"

